# type(scope)!: concise description of the observable change
#
# Explain why the change is needed and any decision that is not obvious from
# the diff. Wrap freely; only the first line is limited to 100 characters.
#
# BREAKING CHANGE: state exactly what an installation has to do before upgrade.
#
# Remove the ! and BREAKING CHANGE footer when the change is not breaking.
# The scope is optional. Common scopes are auth, oidc, api, packaging and watch.
#
# Types: feat, fix, perf, refactor, docs, build, ci, test, chore, style, revert
# Subject: lower case after the colon and no full stop.
